        "text": "checkpoint requires non-null checkpoint; state requires non-null state; review requires non-null dimensions (1..3 distinct A/C/R) and verdict; comment requires non-null comment_text with at least one non-whitespace character; relate/unrelate require non-null relation_kind and related_task_id."
