      {
        "anchor": "class TaskArchiveRequest",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/application/task_requests.py",
        "text": "archive requires either non-null archive_note or non-null note at canonical model level. Runtime selects raw archive_note if truthy, else note; it then strips and requires non-whitespace text. archive_note=\"   \" masks valid note fallback and fails; supply one meaningful field. create with state=done requires non-null result."
      },
      {
        "anchor": "model_dump(exclude_none=True, exclude_unset=True)",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/mcp/roles.py",
        "text": "The handler serializes with exclude_none=True and exclude_unset=True; update description:null is omitted/no change, while tags:[] explicitly replaces the stored list with an empty list. Other explicit non-null collection values replace, not append."
      },
      {
        "anchor": "if relation_kind == \"review_of\":",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/storage/tasks.py",
        "text": "relation_kind is an open string(1..64), not an enum. For relation_kind=review_of on relate: source lane must be review; parent candidate_ref must be nonempty; no different review_of parent; source candidate_ref if set must match parent, otherwise it is bound from parent. Possible errors review_task_required, missing_parent_candidate, ambiguous_review_parent, candidate_conflict."
      },
      {
        "anchor": "async def _action_update(",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/core/tasks.py",
        "text": "Canonical update/mutation state transitions and task revision checks remain enforced by the existing server; an omitted optional field may mean no mutation."
      },
      {
        "anchor": "Create operation identity. Reuse only on transport retries",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/mcp/role_contracts.py",
        "text": "request_id on create is the stable operation identity; reuse only on transport retries of the same create; independent creates need a fresh request_id."
      },
      {
        "action": "update",
        "anchor": "SAFE_PARTICIPANT_FIELDS = frozenset({\"title\", \"description\", \"next_action\", \"tags\"})",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/core/tasks.py",
        "text": "With a live claim, nonowner update permits only safe participant fields title, description, next_action, tags; workflow fields or non-null dependencies require live owner (owner_required). expected_revision is required."
      },
